nt of the grounds for denial.\",\"start\":0}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:7af57c290e0033d8d25ea078ffd6faa0196d1e636885ca533d713f6e4dc1b6a5\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:5fcbe6dae4129029094a4f58aa5da5290865dc73a3d96d82035b316f248ddbd7\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"shall\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:caa0b67df01e169ae44cd1fbf664b436dc7dabb05841d8b980dd2520c28032c5\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(e) Prompt notice shall be given of the denial in whole or in part of a written application, petition, or other request of an interested person made in connection with any agency proceeding. Except in affirming a prior denial or when the denial is self-explanatory, the notice shall be accompanied by a brief statement of the grounds for denial.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:459acc74fa36035c0010ea7ccf015342aedc603c5e750c28355dbbbdaa2d9f1a\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(e) Prompt notice shall be given of the denial in whole or in part of a written application, petition, or other request of an interested person made in connection with any agency proceeding. Except in affirming a prior denial or when the denial is self-explanatory, the notice shall be accompanied by a brief statement of the grounds for denial.\"],\"scope_text\":\"denial in whole or in part of a written application, petition, or other request of an interested person made in connection with any agency proceeding\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":0,\"summary\":\"Prompt notice shall be given of the denial in whole or in part of a written application, petition, or other request of an interested person made in connection with any agency proceeding.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
